# V5 release builds select exactly one complete, versioned manifest. Never set both flags.
# UAT may use the committed manifest in web/src/v5ReleaseConfig.js. Mainnet requires the full
# JSON manifest in VITE_V5_RELEASE_MANIFEST and the build fails if it is absent or malformed.
